---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {defaultWatermark} from '../server/watermark';
import {db} from '../server/db';
import {dataDir,type Channel} from '../server/config';
import {mediaSize} from '../lib/media';
import {statSync} from 'node:fs';
import {join} from 'node:path';
interface Props{channel:Channel}
const {channel}=Astro.props,mark={...defaultWatermark,...JSON.parse(channel.watermark)};
const dimensions=mark.logo?db.prepare('SELECT width,height FROM logos WHERE id=? AND owner_id=?').get(mark.logo,channel.owner_id) as {width:number;height:number}|undefined:null;
let bytes=0;try{if(mark.logo)bytes=statSync(join(dataDir,'logos',mark.logo+'.png')).size;}catch{}
const full=mark.style==='full'||mark.style==='auto'&&dimensions&&dimensions.width>=1280&&Math.abs(dimensions.width/dimensions.height-16/9)<0.05;
const boot={...mark,style:full?'full':'corner'};
---
<section class="card"><div class="card-heading"><h2>Marca de agua</h2><span class="badge blue">Directo y respaldo</span></div><form data-watermark data-channel={channel.id} data-settings={JSON.stringify(boot)}>
<div class="watermark-grid"><div><div class="composition-preview"><img class="composition-background" src="/images/demo-fotograma.jpg" alt="Imagen de muestra proporcionada para la vista previa"/><span class="safe-area" aria-hidden="true"></span><img class="composition-logo" data-logo-preview src={mark.logo&&bytes?`/api/channels/${channel.id}-logo.png?logo=${mark.logo}`:undefined} alt="Marca de agua en la vista previa" hidden={!mark.logo||!bytes}/></div><div class="preview-caption"><span>Vista previa · imagen de muestra</span><span>Cuadro 16:9</span></div><p class="hint">La previsualización no es la señal en vivo. La marca se aplica a la salida al guardar.</p></div>
<div class="form-fields"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" checked={mark.enabled}/>Activar marca de agua</label><input type="hidden" name="logo" value={mark.logo}/><div><strong>Formato</strong><div class="segmented"><label><input type="radio" name="style" value="corner" checked={!full}/><span>Logo</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="style" value="full" checked={!!full}/><span>Composición completa</span></label></div></div><div data-logo-controls class="form-fields"><label>Posición<select name="position">{[['top-left','Superior izquierda'],['top-right','Superior derecha'],['bottom-left','Inferior izquierda'],['bottom-right','Inferior derecha']].map(([value,label])=><option value={value} selected={mark.position===value}>{label}</option>)}</select></label><div class="two-fields"><label>Ancho del logo (%)<input type="number" name="size" min="3" max="50" value={mark.size}/></label><label>Opacidad (%)<input type="number" name="opacity" min="0" max="100" value={mark.opacity}/></label></div></div><p class="hint" data-style-help></p><div class="file-control"><input type="file" accept="image/png" data-logo-file id="watermark-file" hidden/><button class="button outline" type="button" data-pick-logo><Icon name="image" size={18}/>Seleccionar PNG</button><small data-logo-file-name>{mark.logo&&bytes?`PNG guardado · ${dimensions?.width} × ${dimensions?.height} · ${mediaSize(bytes)}`:'Ninguna imagen seleccionada'}</small></div><p class="hint">Máximo 5 MiB y 4096 × 4096 px. Se recomienda fondo transparente.</p><div class="button-row"><button class="button" type="button" data-upload-logo>Subir imagen</button><button class="button" type="button" data-use-saved-logo data-logo={mark.logo} disabled={!mark.logo||!bytes}>Usar PNG guardado</button></div><a class="text-link" href={`/cliente/conexion/?channel=${channel.id}`}>Configurar fps en el perfil de emisión <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a></div></div>
<div class="card-body"><div data-form-result role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="watermark-footer"><p class="hint">Guardar puede reiniciar la composición. El reproductor puede necesitar unos segundos para recuperar la señal.</p><div class="button-row"><button class="button" type="button" data-reset-watermark>Restaurar valores</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">Guardar marca de agua</button></div></div></form></section>
<script>import '../scripts/watermark';</script>
